# Privacy Architecture
mv:PrivacyArchitecture a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf mv:SystemArchitecture ;
    rdfs:label "Privacy Architecture"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A systematic design framework that embeds data protection principles into software systems from inception, incorporating privacy-by-design methodologies, access controls, anonymization techniques, and compliance mechanisms to safeguard personal information."@en ;
