# Standards Conformance Testing
mv:StandardsConformanceTesting a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf mv:Standards ;
    rdfs:label "Standards Conformance Testing"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Testing or verification activities that determine whether a process, product, or service complies with the requirements of a specification, technical standard, contract, or regulation, verifying that implementations faithfully meet specified requirements."@en ;
