# Standards Validation
mv:StandardsValidation a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf mv:Standards ;
    rdfs:label "Standards Validation"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Processes used to determine whether development products conform to requirements and whether the final product satisfies its intended use and user needs, confirming that the correct product was built to meet stakeholder goals."@en ;
