# Virtual Factory
mv:VirtualFactory a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf mv:DigitalTwin ;
    rdfs:label "Virtual Factory"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A physically accurate digital twin representation of a manufacturing facility that enables modeling, simulation, analysis, and optimization of production processes, resources, and operations without requiring physical prototypes or pilot plants."@en ;
