# Virtual Field Trip
mv:VirtualFieldTrip a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf mv:EducationalTechnology ;
    rdfs:label "Virtual Field Trip"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An educational experience using VR, AR, or MR technologies that transports students to locations they could not otherwise visit, enabling immersive learning through 360-degree environments, interactive simulations, and experiential content without leaving the classroom."@en ;
