    rdfs:comment "The underlying technical foundation required to operate metaverse platforms, encompassing cloud computing services, edge networks, distributed systems, real-time rendering capabilities, networking protocols, and blockchain integration that together enable persistent, scalable virtual environments with low-latency user interactions."@en ;
