# Distributed System Architecture
mv:DistributedSystemArchitecture a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf mv:SystemArchitecture ;
    rdfs:label "Distributed System Architecture"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An architectural paradigm for metaverse systems that distributes computing resources, data storage, and processing across multiple interconnected nodes to achieve scalability, fault tolerance, and low-latency experiences whilst supporting millions of concurrent users."@en ;
